================================================================================
What this Dataset adds to the source
================================================================================

The City of Melbourne publishes the current status of each parking bay sensor
and does not publish history. This Dataset is a derivative work: bay-level
snapshots were polled on a 30-minute grid, aggregated into the city's own
zones, and stored as a time series. Zone names, coordinates and bay counts
come from the source unchanged.

Independently verify the upstream terms before relying on this Dataset for
commercial products, redistribution under a different licence, regulated
industries, or large-scale republication: those terms may have been updated
after this Dataset was produced.

